# DENTAL-CHART-ASSET-R3 — odontogram morphology reference plates.
#
# Ten ~1 MB raster study plates used as MORPHOLOGY GUIDANCE ONLY while
# authoring the vector tooth registry. They are never traced, never embedded
# and never shipped: nothing under src/ references them, and the production
# assets are the hand-authored SVG paths in
# src/components/odontogram/{lateral,occlusal}/.
#
# Deliberately not committed. ~10 MB of binaries that no build, test or
# runtime path reads would be paid for by every clone and every CI checkout
# forever, in exchange for provenance that design/dental-chart/final-svg/ and
# the AUTHORING.md tables already record in text. See the README in that
# directory for how to restore them.
design/dental-chart/reference-plates/*.png
